\f1\b PulseMuse Website Overview\b0\f0\par
\fs20 Prepared on April 7, 2026\par
\fs24\par
\f1\b 1. Introduction\b0\f0\par
PulseMuse is a browser-based music website prototype inspired by modern streaming platforms. It combines music discovery, AI-assisted interaction, a prompt-based music generator, Apple Music integration work, and YouTube-based genre suggestions into one dashboard-style experience.\par
\par
\f1\b 2. Main Features\b0\f0\par
\tab \bullet\tab Local sign-up and sign-in system using user ID and password.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Personal library that stores saved tracks for each user in the browser.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Editorial dashboard layout with a custom-designed interface.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Discover section with curated in-app music mixes.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Genre atlas for browsing across many music genres.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Generator lab for creating music ideas using mood, tempo, and energy controls.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Talking AI assistant that can respond through typed chat.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Optional voice interaction using browser speech recognition and speech synthesis.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Now playing bar with playback status, progress, and source information.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Quick actions such as shuffle and featured picks.\par
\par
\f1\b 3. Apple Music Features\b0\f0\par
\tab \bullet\tab Apple Music dock for loading Apple Music links into the website.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Fields for Apple Music developer token and storefront configuration.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Connect Apple Music button for MusicKit setup.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Authorize account button for Apple Music user authorization.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Featured Apple Music picks including songs, albums, playlists, and music videos.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Fallback preview playback when full Apple Music playback is not available.\par
\par
\f1\b 4. YouTube Recommendation Features\b0\f0\par
\tab \bullet\tab Separate YouTube lanes section for external playlist and genre discovery.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Direct YouTube suggestion categories such as UK Drill Rap, Romance, Afrobeats, Bollywood, K-Pop, and Lo-fi.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Open on YouTube buttons that send users directly to YouTube results or playlist-style searches.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Assistant support for YouTube-related requests such as genre playlists and music-video searches.\par
\par
\f1\b 5. AI and Interactive Features\b0\f0\par
\tab \bullet\tab Conversational assistant that can answer music-related requests.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Assistant can suggest tracks, genres, and discovery lanes.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Assistant can react to user prompts like mood-based recommendations and video-related requests.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Typing indicator and conversational response flow for a more natural experience.\par
\par
\f1\b 6. Design and User Experience\b0\f0\par
\tab \bullet\tab Unique editorial visual layout rather than a plain template-based interface.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Animated sections, hover effects, and a more immersive dashboard design.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Responsive behavior for desktop and mobile browsing.\par
\tab \bullet\tab Strong visual separation between discovery tools, media tools, and assistant features.\par
\par
\f1\b 7. Current Prototype Notes\b0\f0\par
PulseMuse is currently a prototype. The strongest built-in features are the local music generator, the assistant experience, per-user library handling, curated browsing, and YouTube recommendation lanes. External streaming playback depends on the limits and setup requirements of third-party platforms such as Apple Music.\par
\par
\f1\b 8. Conclusion\b0\f0\par
PulseMuse is designed as a creative music web app that blends streaming-style browsing, AI interaction, music generation, and external discovery tools. It aims to offer a richer and more experimental experience than a standard music landing page.\par
